        "type": "nodetool.workflows.base_node.Comment",
        "data": {
          "comment": "# Comfy MiniMax H3- Text to Image\n\nGenerate a single still image from a text prompt with MiniMax H3, an omni-modal video model used here for its first-frame decode. No file inputs required: the graph samples an empty latent and decodes it through the H3 video VAE. Best suited to a single subject with a defined light source and a simple or blurred background. Runs on Comfy Cloud and needs a COMFY_API_KEY.\n\n**How it works:** The Comfy nodes form the complete template graph. Run submits the graph to Comfy Cloud and saves its outputs.\n\n**Try this:** Change the prompt or the Load node inputs and run again to compare results.\n\nSource: https://github.com/Comfy-Org/workflow_templates/blob/1ae390968e323dba24a6991d1860ded051f5a79b/templates/image_minimax_h3_t2i.json (MIT). Model licenses apply separately."
        },
